Z||000000||fierospeeder||12-04-2000||05:18 PM||||I was wondering if anyone downloaded the 5.5 version, i think its the beta.<P>But im having problem with sites like this and ebay where you have to use keys like tab or enter to send data.  Im not sure if its java or visual basic.  Anyway, its causing my internet explorer to freeze briefly, after the delay it gets to page i want.<P>example<P>ebay<BR>i type in  fieros in the key search, i will press enter and it will freeze up, after 5 seconds, it will take me to the list of fiero items.   The search button doesn't move when i press enter, my old explorer you can see how the button has that shadow showing how its pressed down.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Black88GT||12-04-2000||09:27 PM||||Did you try clearing out your "temporary internet" folder?<P>A lot of times it has so much junk it in it will slow down your computer or even freeze it.<P>Just go to Favorites on the top, Internet options, and the second option from the top is "Temporary internet files" and a delete button.<P>How about your RAM?  How much do you have?  Are you operating any other programs while you have the IE open?<P>I have learned a lot about this sort of problem after all the similar problems I have had with my computer.  Same type thing, except sometimes it won't "unfreeze".  My RAM was bad and I had a sh!tload of temporary internet files that I deleted.  Seem to cure it somewhat but I am still having issues with other programs...<P>  <P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">       <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||1
